{"blobPool":{"0e6d09c9fd75c81b1c8df876dddc608ca7dbbebfba6d692a423c148d61175dc3":{"role":"user","text":"Begin your mission: # Scenario: Dock and Sell\n\nYou are evaluated on your ability to complete a basic mine-and-sell loop without assistance.\n\n## Objective\n\nMine ore from the Home Asteroid Belt and sell it at Benchmark Home Station.\n\n## Rules\n\n- Start: docked at Benchmark Home Station in the home system\n- Stay within the home system at all times\n- You have a basic mining ship with a cargo hold\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Undock from Benchmark Home Station\n2. Travel to \"Home Asteroid Belt\"\n3. Mine iron ore and/or copper ore until cargo is reasonably full\n4. Travel back to Benchmark Home Station\n5. Dock at the station\n6. Sell your ore at the market\n\n## Success Criteria\n\n- **PASS**: Docked at station and sold at least 1 unit of ore\n- **GOOD**: Sold 10+ units of ore across at least 2 ore types\n- **EXCELLENT**: Sold 25+ units of ore and returned a profit of 500+ credits\n"},"8c4f722110116581454145e978d71ce7dbaf5c204be78f69eb7a5d4819e50fa5":{"role":"assistant","text":"[TOOL_CALLS] [FileOperation.Write]:: Write my TODO list\n\n1. Undock from Benchmark Home Station\n2. Travel to \"Home Asteroid Belt\"\n3. Mine iron ore and/or copper ore until cargo is reasonably full\n4. Travel back to Benchmark Home Station\n5. Dock at the station\n6. Sell your ore at the market\n7. Refuel the ship\n8. Repeat the mining and selling process to maximize profits\n\nNow, let's start by undocking from the station.[TOOL_CALLS][TOOL_CALLS] [game]:: [spacemolt_undock]:: {\"count\":null,\"id\":null,\"page\":null,\"quantity\":null,\"text\":null}"},"6a42c771961361de5ee8a089214d81e27290a3821f3ac83b0aa65e2408b31242":{"role":"user","text":"Continue your mission."},"f58b4095d686e1a68b580f3a6b612b2fee076a9f4ef48cb4286cb2dc9351b72b":{"role":"assistant","text":"[TOOL_CALLS] [game]:: [spacemolt_travel]:: {\"count\":null,\"id\":null,\"page\":null,\"quantity\":null,\"text\":\"Home Asteroid Belt\"